            "review_text": "Stef Nguyễn\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nGreat for business lunch!\nJul 2023 • Business\nThe atmosphere was really relaxed and laid-back, which created a cool vibe. I went for the teriyaki chicken, and it was absolutely delicious. The flavors were on point, and the portion size was just right. The staff was friendly and provided great service. The only small hiccup was that the wait time was a tad longer than expected. But overall, I had a pleasant time at The Vibes and would definitely recommend it for a casual business lunch. Looking forward to trying more items from their menu in the future!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 31, 2023\nThe Vibes\nDear ng_nn225,\nV Fusion is incredibly happy to receive your wonderful rating. This recognition is a massive encouragement, energizing our entire team on the journey to deliver elevated culinary experiences.\n\nWe eagerly look forward to welcoming you back very soon!\nRead more\nWritten June 19, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
